---
layout: base.njk
title: Sponsor the PTSA
permalink: /sponsor-us/
---
<div class="page-banner">
  <h1>Sponsor the PTSA!</h1>
  <p>🌵 It Takes a Village to Raise a Sidewinder 🌵</p>
</div>

<section class="section">
  <h2>Join Us!</h2>
  <p>
    Local businesses, families, and community partners are invited to become Sidewinder Strong
    Sponsors. Your support helps fund student enrichment, family events, staff appreciation, and
    other programs that strengthen the Saguaro Creek community.
  </p>
  <p>
    Choose the sponsorship level that best fits your goals and receive recognition through spirit
    shirts, PTSA communications, our website, events and social media!
  </p>
  <div class="button-row">
    <a class="btn btn-big" href="{{ site.store }}">Click here to sponsor the PTSA! →</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <h2>How to Become a Sponsor</h2>
  <ol class="steps">
    <li>Visit the <a href="{{ site.store }}">Store</a> and select <strong>Sponsors</strong>.</li>
    <li>Choose and purchase your preferred sponsorship level.</li>
    <li>Send an email with your logo to <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>.</li>
  </ol>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <h2>Sidewinder Strong Sponsorship Tiers</h2>
  {% for t in tiers.items %}
  <article class="tier-card tier-{{ t.name | lower }}">
    <header class="tier-head">
      <span class="tier-badge">{{ t.name }}</span>
      <h3>{{ t.price }} — {{ t.label }}</h3>
    </header>
    <p class="tier-tagline">{{ t.tagline }}</p>
    <p class="tier-sub">Sponsors at this level will receive:</p>
    <ul>
      {% for b in t.benefits %}<li>{{ b }}</li>{% endfor %}
    </ul>
    <p><a class="btn" href="{{ site.store }}">Sponsor at {{ t.name }} level</a></p>
  </article>
  {% endfor %}
</section>

<section class="section">
  <h2>🌵 Want to support the Sidewinders in your own way?</h2>
  <p>
    We offer flexible sponsorship opportunities and would love to work with you.
    Contact us at <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a> to learn more!
  </p>
</section>
